<section>
    <h3>Replay mode</h3>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 960 380" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="width: 100%; max-height: 440px;" font-family="sans-serif" role="img" aria-label="In replay mode, the request is redacted then compared with the entries of the HAR file; when found, the response is replayed without the network, when missing, an exception is thrown">
        <defs>
            <marker id="arr-rep" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
                <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" fill="#7A6F66"/>
            </marker>
            <marker id="arr-rep-green" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
                <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" fill="#2B8A3E"/>
            </marker>
            <marker id="arr-rep-red" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
                <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" fill="#C92A2A"/>
            </marker>
        </defs>

        <!-- File -->
        <rect x="770" y="16" width="170" height="64" rx="10" fill="#FFFDF7" stroke="#1F1A17" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="6 4"/>
        <text x="855" y="54" text-anchor="middle" fill="#1F1A17" font-size="17" font-weight="bold">testX.har</text>
        <line class="flow" x1="855" y1="80" x2="855" y2="126" stroke="#7A6F66" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr-rep)"/>

        <!-- Request -->
        <rect x="20" y="130" width="170" height="84" rx="10" fill="#FFFDF7" stroke="#E6D9C3" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <text x="105" y="178" text-anchor="middle" fill="#1F1A17" font-size="18" font-weight="bold">Your test</text>

        <rect x="230" y="130" width="200" height="84" rx="10" fill="#FFE8D6" stroke="#E8590C" stroke-width="2.5"/>
        <text x="330" y="178" text-anchor="middle" fill="#1F1A17" font-size="17" font-weight="bold">RecorderHttpClient</text>

        <rect x="475" y="130" width="200" height="84" rx="10" fill="#FFF4E6" stroke="#E67700" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <text x="575" y="164" text-anchor="middle" fill="#1F1A17" font-size="17" font-weight="bold">DefaultRedactor</text>
        <text x="575" y="190" text-anchor="middle" fill="#7A6F66" font-size="14">redacts the request</text>

        <rect x="720" y="130" width="220" height="84" rx="10" fill="#E3F6F8" stroke="#0C8599" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <text x="830" y="164" text-anchor="middle" fill="#1F1A17" font-size="17" font-weight="bold">Comparison</text>
        <text x="830" y="190" text-anchor="middle" fill="#7A6F66" font-size="14">method, URL, body</text>

        <line class="flow" x1="190" y1="172" x2="226" y2="172" stroke="#7A6F66" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr-rep)"/>
        <line class="flow" x1="430" y1="172" x2="471" y2="172" stroke="#7A6F66" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr-rep)"/>
        <line class="flow" x1="675" y1="172" x2="716" y2="172" stroke="#7A6F66" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr-rep)"/>

        <!-- Found -->
        <g class="fragment">
            <path class="flow" d="M745,214 V328 H679" fill="none" stroke="#2B8A3E" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr-rep-green)"/>
            <text x="712" y="318" text-anchor="middle" fill="#2B8A3E" font-size="14" font-weight="bold">found</text>
            <rect x="230" y="290" width="445" height="76" rx="10" fill="#EBFBEE" stroke="#2B8A3E" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <text x="452" y="322" text-anchor="middle" fill="#1F1A17" font-size="17" font-weight="bold">Response replayed by MockHttpClient</text>
            <text x="452" y="348" text-anchor="middle" fill="#2B8A3E" font-size="15">no network call</text>
            <path class="flow" d="M230,328 H105 V218" fill="none" stroke="#2B8A3E" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr-rep-green)"/>
        </g>

        <!-- Missing -->
        <g class="fragment">
            <line class="flow" x1="880" y1="214" x2="880" y2="286" stroke="#C92A2A" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr-rep-red)"/>
            <text x="888" y="256" fill="#C92A2A" font-size="14" font-weight="bold">missing</text>
            <rect x="780" y="290" width="160" height="76" rx="10" fill="#FFE8D6" stroke="#C92A2A" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <text x="860" y="322" text-anchor="middle" fill="#1F1A17" font-size="16" font-weight="bold">Exception</text>
            <text x="860" y="348" text-anchor="middle" fill="#C92A2A" font-size="14">the test fails</text>
        </g>
    </svg>
    <p class="fragment subtitle" style="font-size: 0.55em; margin-top: 0;">
        With <code>SYMFONY_HTTP_RECORDER=missing</code>, a missing entry triggers the real call, which gets recorded.
    </p>
    <aside class="notes">
        In replay mode, the request of the test is redacted the same way as when it was recorded, then compared with the entries of the file. Found: MockHttpClient serves the response. Missing: HarEntryNotFoundException, and above all no network call, unless you asked for it explicitly at launch with SYMFONY_HTTP_RECORDER=missing.
    </aside>
</section>
